>> # HOMIO / REOS — PowerShell → GitHub Sync Workflow
>>
>> ## Purpose and active scope
>>
>> This document defines the safe, repeatable workflow for authenticated PowerShell-to-GitHub operations.
>>
>> - Repository: `prajaktaranjane80-sketch/Homio`
>> - Canonical branch: `reos-development`
>> - Canonical code/history source: GitHub branch `reos-development`
>> - Canonical state authority: `REOS_CONTROL_CENTER/data/state.json`
>> - Diagnostic evidence: `REOS_CONTROL_CENTER/Ps Output`
>>
>> **Scope rule:** Work only on the task explicitly authorized in the current conversation. A workflow-only task must not start CORE-008 implementation, frontend changes, ACRL changes, or state transitions. Do not modify `data/state.json` as part of workflow repair.
>>
>> ## Non-negotiable safety rules
>>
>> 1. Never print, save, paste, or commit access tokens.
>> 2. Verify the authenticated GitHub account and exact repository before any write.
>> 3. Read the live branch HEAD and exact target file/blob immediately before preparing a write.
>> 4. Create the new commit with the verified live HEAD as its parent.
>> 5. Re-read the branch HEAD immediately before moving the ref.
>> 6. Update the branch only through a non-force ref update. If the update is rejected, inspect the latest HEAD and rebuild; never force-push.
>> 7. After writing, independently read the commit, parent, changed path/blob, resulting content, and branch HEAD.
>> 8. Record only verified facts and actual test/CI results in `REOS_CONTROL_CENTER/Ps Output`.
>> 9. Do not treat local output or intended actions as proof of a remote commit.
>> 10. Make one approved change at a time. Do not create a parallel workflow runner or edit unrelated files.
>>
>> ## Read-first preflight
>>
>> Run in PowerShell:
>>
>> ```powershell
>> $ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'
>> $Repo = 'prajaktaranjane80-sketch/Homio'
>> $Branch = 'reos-development'
>>
>> gh auth status
>> if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw 'GitHub CLI authentication failed.' }
>>
>> $me = gh api user
>> if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw 'Cannot verify authenticated GitHub user.' }
>> $me = $me | ConvertFrom-Json
>>
>> $repoData = gh api "repos/$Repo"
>> if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw "Cannot read repository: $Repo" }
>> $repoData = $repoData | ConvertFrom-Json
>>
>> $ref = gh api "repos/$Repo/git/ref/heads/$Branch"
>> if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw "Cannot read branch: $Branch" }
>> $ref = $ref | ConvertFrom-Json
>>
>> [pscustomobject]@{
>>     AuthenticatedUser = $me.login
>>     Repository        = $repoData.full_name
>>     PushPermission    = $repoData.permissions.push
>>     Branch            = $Branch
>>     LiveHead          = $ref.object.sha
>> } | Format-List
>>
